# VHS Ultra-Short Demo for LinkedIn
Output nahkoda_express.gif
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 400
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

# Setup hidden
Hide
Type "go build -o nahkoda main.go"
Enter
Ctrl+L
Show

# 1. KRU
Type "./nahkoda liat kru"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Ctrl+L

# 2. ARMADA
Type "./nahkoda liat armada"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Ctrl+L

# 3. GELADAK
Type "./nahkoda liat geladak"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

# End fast
Type "# ✅ Sat-set K8s!"
Sleep 2s
